  "albumInformation": "<p><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 20px;\">The Crypts have been hypothesizin' up a storm. The latest batch of songs have been tested in laboratories and have been proven to cure the common cold. The band is faster and stronger than they've ever been thanks to the help of top secret chemical formulas and lots of beeps and boops.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 20px;\">The Crypts are:</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 20px;\">Mike Tschirn: Drumbeats and Hugs</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 20px;\">Kristin \"Monster Rock\" Tschirn: Git-box and Attitude</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 20px;\">Nathaniel Miller: Harmonica and PBR's</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 20px;\">Craig Graziano: Vocals and Useless Trivia</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 20px;\">Larry \"The Professor\" Gilliam: Keys and Sweetness</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 20px;\">Produced by Matt Luger at Kole Labs</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 20px;\"> </span></p>",
